OL,3,GNEWSAWill 4,000 new cameras make train 
OL,4,Ajourneys safer?                        
OL,6,FMore than 4,000 CCTV cameras have been 
OL,7,Finstalled at railway stations in the   
OL,8,FWest Midlands as part of a #7.3m       
OL,9,Fsecurity upgrade.                      
OL,11,FThe new cameras are designed to tackle 
OL,12,Fanti-social behaviour, help staff and  
OL,13,Fpolice respond more quickly to         
OL,14,Fincidents and provide better evidence  
OL,15,Fin investigations.                     
OL,17,FWest Midlands Railway said 160 CCTV    
OL,18,Ffiles have already been shared with    
OL,19,Fpolice in a single month to support    
OL,20,Fongoing cases.                         
